    "text": "ACEN profit jumps 411% to PHP 3.9B in H1 August 11, 2026 ACEN Corp. posted a 411% year-on-year jump in consolidated net income to PHP 3.9 billion in the first half of 2026, as stronger renewable generation, contracted energy sales and favorable market conditions boosted results across its markets. In its disclosure today, the Ayala group’s listed energy platform said attributable renewable generation rose 21% to 4,024 GWh, while core attributable EBITDA increased 40% to PHP 14.7 billion. Its attributable renewable energy capacity reached 7,517 MW, with 57% of the portfolio now operational.",
